          <a 
            href={registerUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300 text-slate-950 font-black text-center text-sm shadow-lg shadow-amber-400/20 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-95"
          >
            🚀 45 Gün Ücretsiz Başla (Kredi Kartı Gerekmez) →
